{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122144007620-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122151153\"/><p>男子昏迷送院。</p><p>尖沙咀發生交通意外。今午(22日)2時28分，一輛私家車駛經寶勒巷時失事，剷上行人路撞向一間店舖，意外釀4人受傷，其中1名男子陷入昏迷。據了解，涉事司機棄車逃去。警員正設法追查司機下落。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:23:53.210720+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:40:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:25.302903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:25.302903+00:00","content_hash":"3ab504a79167136877d1c6e180b59224dc95856f70f22c2273744ee989de56aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}